---
import type { SiteLocale } from "@tgbox/shared";
import JsonLd from "@/components/layout/JsonLd.astro";
import { localizePath } from "@/i18n/locale.ts";
import { ui } from "@/i18n/ui.ts";
import { seoUi } from "@/i18n/ui-seo.ts";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { faqJsonLd } from "@/lib/json-ld.ts";
import { aboutSeo } from "@/lib/seo.ts";
import { botUrl, botUsername, licence, repoUrl } from "@/lib/site.ts";

interface Props {
  locale: SiteLocale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale !== "en";
const bot = `@${botUsername}`;
const seo = aboutSeo(locale);
const { faq, faqHeading } = seoUi(locale);
// PageLayout's breadcrumb nav emits its own BreadcrumbList. Google retired FAQ rich results in
// 2026, but the markup still helps answer engines parse the page.
const jsonLd = [faqJsonLd(faq)];
---

<PageLayout
  locale={locale}
  title={ui(locale).page.about}
  metaTitle={seo.title}
  metaDescription={seo.description}
  keywords={seo.keywords}
  eyebrow="About"
  updated="2026-11-11"
  description={zh
      ? "TGsearch 是支持简体中文、繁体中文和英文的 Telegram 综合资源导航，数据自动更新，失效条目经多次确认后下架。"
      : "TGsearch is a Telegram resource directory in Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese and English. Data is refreshed automatically, and dead entries are removed after repeated checks."}
>
  <JsonLd slot="head" data={jsonLd} />
  {zh ? (
      <>
        <p>Telegram 上有大量优质的公开频道、群组和机器人，但自带的搜索很弱，中文用户很难发现好内容。很多导航站内容单薄、数据长期不更新，收录的频道早已被封或停更，页面却还挂着。TGsearch 想把这件事做得更好。</p>

        <h2>我们做什么</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>信息充实</strong>：条目展示公开页上能取到的头像、简介、分类、标签、语言、成员数、创建时间和收录时间。频道另显示活跃度，并可预览最近消息，最多约 20 条。</li>
          <li><strong>数据新鲜</strong>：系统定时从 Telegram 公开页面刷新资料。被封、不存在或转私有的条目，经多次检测确认后自动下架。</li>
          <li><strong>提交简单</strong>：维护者在 Telegram 里私聊 <a href={botUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{bot}</a> 发送频道、群组或机器人链接即可提交，审核结果会私信通知。详见<a href={localizePath("/enroll/", locale)}>提交收录说明</a>。</li>
          <li><strong>三种语言</strong>：目录页面提供简体中文、繁体中文和英文，可在页眉或页脚切换。</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>推广标记</h2>
        <p>部分条目是付费或合作展示。它们带有“推广”标记，并在对应推广位展示，与普通条目区分开。</p>

        <h2>快速、轻量</h2>
        <p>整个网站是预先生成的静态页面，浏览无需注册或登录。我们可能使用不设置 Cookie 的访问统计（例如 Cloudflare Web Analytics）了解页面访问量，这类统计不识别个人身份。本站日后如投放广告，广告服务可能会使用 Cookie，例如用于统计展示或衡量效果；启用前，我们会更新<a href={localizePath("/privacy-policy/", locale)}>隐私政策</a>，说明这些 Cookie 的用途。Cloudflare 会为保障安全和防范滥用，处理 IP 地址等请求信息。页面在弱网和手机上也能快速打开，也可以添加到手机主屏幕，像 App 一样使用。</p>

        <h2>关于本项目</h2>
        <p>TGsearch 是一个基于 tgbox 的开源项目：站点、收录机器人和后台的全部代码都在 GitHub 上公开，以 <a href={licence.url} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{licence.name}</a> 许可证发布。欢迎在 <a href={repoUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{repoUrl}</a> 提 issue、发 PR，或者按许可证自建一份属于你自己的导航站。</p>

        <h2>联系我们</h2>
        <p>发现失效条目、错误分类、违规内容，或者希望删除自己的条目，请私聊 <a href={botUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{bot}</a> 并发送 <code>/help</code> 获取联系方式。</p>

        <h2 id="faq">{faqHeading}</h2>
        {faq.map((item) => (
          <>
            <h3>{item.question}</h3>
            <p>{item.answer}</p>
          </>
        ))}
      </>
    ) : (
      <>
        <p>Telegram is full of great public channels, groups and bots, but its built-in search is weak and good content is hard to discover. Many directories are thin, rarely updated, and keep listing channels that were banned or abandoned long ago. TGsearch aims to do better.</p>

        <h2>What we do</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Rich pages</strong>: an entry shows the avatar, description, category, tags, language, member count, creation date and listing date available from its public page. Channels also show an activity level and preview recent posts, up to about 20.</li>
          <li><strong>Fresh data</strong>: details are refreshed from public Telegram pages on a schedule. Banned, deleted or privatised entries are taken down after repeated checks confirm the change.</li>
          <li><strong>Easy submissions</strong>: maintainers message <a href={botUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{bot}</a> with a channel, group or bot link and get the review result by private message. See the <a href={localizePath("/enroll/", locale)}>submission guide</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Three languages</strong>: directory pages are available in Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese and English. Switch from the header or the footer.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Promoted entries</h2>
        <p>Some entries are paid or partner placements. They carry a “Promoted” label and appear in their promotion slots, separate from regular listings.</p>

        <h2>Fast and light</h2>
        <p>The whole site is pre-built static pages. Browsing needs no registration or sign-in. We may use cookieless analytics (such as Cloudflare Web Analytics) to count page views. These statistics do not identify individuals. If we run advertising later, the ad service may use cookies, for example to count impressions or measure results. Before that starts, we will update the <a href={localizePath("/privacy-policy/", locale)}>privacy policy</a> and describe what those cookies are for. Cloudflare processes request data such as IP addresses for security and abuse prevention. Pages open quickly on slow networks and phones, and you can add the site to your home screen and use it like an app.</p>

        <h2>About this project</h2>
        <p>TGsearch is an open-source project based on tgbox: the site, the submission bot and the admin all live in one public repository, released under the <a href={licence.url} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{licence.name}</a> licence. File an issue or a pull request at <a href={repoUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{repoUrl}</a>, or run your own directory from the same code under the terms of that licence.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>To report a dead entry, a wrong category or abusive content, or to have your own entry removed, message <a href={botUrl} rel="noopener" target="_blank">{bot}</a> and send <code>/help</code> for contact details.</p>

        <h2 id="faq">{faqHeading}</h2>
        {faq.map((item) => (
          <>
            <h3>{item.question}</h3>
            <p>{item.answer}</p>
          </>
        ))}
      </>
    )}
</PageLayout>
